%% Source: Core::new/begin_election/become_leader/step_down/storage_failed.
%% Static role transitions. Persist barrier precedes vote-related sends; not a timing guarantee.
%% Stopped is runtime termination, not a Core Role. Same-term valid AE defensively
%% demotes even a Leader; a second legitimate leader in one term is unreachable
%% under Raft Election Safety and the non-Byzantine assumptions.
stateDiagram-v2
    state "追隨者" as Follower
    state "候選人" as Candidate
    state "領導者" as Leader
    state "執行器停止" as Stopped
    [*] --> Follower: 重啟回復
    Follower --> Candidate: 有效選舉逾時
    Candidate --> Candidate: 有效選舉逾時
    Candidate --> Leader: 兩個不同合法票
    Candidate --> Follower: 有效AE或較高term
    Leader --> Follower: 觀察到較高term
    Leader --> Follower: 同term有效AE
    Follower --> Stopped: 持久化失敗
    Candidate --> Stopped: 持久化失敗
    Leader --> Stopped: 持久化失敗
